### EVELYN - Crear turno correctamente
POST http://localhost:3000/api/turnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Luciana Gonzalez",
  "dni": "45689012",
  "curso": "4 B"
}

### EVELYN - Crear otro turno
POST http://localhost:3000/api/turnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Maria Lopez",
  "dni": "34567890",
  "curso": "4 A"
}

### EVELYN - Faltan campos obligatorios (400)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/turnos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nombre": "Pedro",
  "dni": "12345678"
}

